<title>BRAZIL: Banco Santander Brazil hires private equity chief.</title>
<headline>Banco Santander Brazil hires private equity chief.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Santander SA's Brazilian unit said it has hired Jose Eduardo Martins, former director at Banco Patrimonio, to build its private equity business.</p>
<p>Martins will take his post early April and will be in charge of the bank's strategy in acquisition of minority holdings in companies, spokesmen for Banco Santander in Brazil said in a statement.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
